{"seq":1,"slug":"di-fundamentals","title":"依赖注入基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/dependency-injection/di-fundamentals","wordCount":836,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"依赖注入基础\">依赖注入基础</h1><p>依赖注入（Dependency Injection, DI）是实现松耦合架构的核心技术。本文介绍 DI 的三种注入方式、IoC 容器与手动 DI 的对比，以及 Service Locator 反模式。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>依赖注入的核心思想是：<strong>一个对象不应该自己创建它所依赖的对象，而应该由外部提供</strong>。它由三个概念支撑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>注入方式</strong>：构造器注入、属性注入、方法注入，决定依赖如何传入</li>\n<li><strong>IoC 容器 vs 手动 DI</strong>：手动 DI 在组合根显式装配依赖，容器则集中注册并按需解析</li>\n<li><strong>Service Locator 反模式</strong>：对象主动向定位器索取依赖，隐藏了真实依赖关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判别的关键是<strong>依赖是否显式</strong>：注入让依赖出现在构造器签名里、便于测试与替换；而 Service Locator 把依赖藏进运行时查找，因此被视为反模式。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"什么是依赖注入\">什么是依赖注入</h2><p>依赖注入的核心思想是：<strong>一个对象不应该自己创建它所依赖的对象，而应该由外部提供</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Without[&quot;❌ 无 DI&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;ViewModel&quot;] --&gt;|自己创建| B1[&quot;NetworkService()&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph With[&quot;✅ 有 DI&quot;]&#10;        Creator[&quot;外部创建者&quot;] --&gt;|注入| A2[&quot;ViewModel&quot;]&#10;        Creator --&gt;|创建| B2[&quot;NetworkService&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    classDef bad fill:none,stroke:#F44336&#10;    classDef good fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;    classDef neutral fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;&#10;    class A1,B1 bad&#10;    class A2,B2 good&#10;    class Creator neutral\">graph LR\n    subgraph Without[\"❌ 无 DI\"]\n        A1[\"ViewModel\"] --&gt;|自己创建| B1[\"NetworkService()\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph With[\"✅ 有 DI\"]\n        Creator[\"外部创建者\"] --&gt;|注入| A2[\"ViewModel\"]\n        Creator --&gt;|创建| B2[\"NetworkService\"]\n    end\n\n    classDef bad fill:none,stroke:#F44336\n    classDef good fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n    classDef neutral fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n\n    class A1,B1 bad\n    class A2,B2 good\n    class Creator neutral</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"三种注入方式\">三种注入方式</h2><h3 id=\"构造器注入-constructor-injection\">构造器注入（Constructor Injection）</h3><p>最推荐的方式，在初始化时提供所有依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol AnalyticsServiceProtocol {&#10;    func track(event: String, properties: [String: Any])&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol UserRepositoryProtocol {&#10;    func fetchCurrentUser() async throws -&gt; User&#10;}&#10;&#10;final class DashboardViewModel: ObservableObject {&#10;    @Published var user: User?&#10;&#10;    private let userRepository: UserRepositoryProtocol&#10;    private let analytics: AnalyticsServiceProtocol&#10;&#10;    init(userRepository: UserRepositoryProtocol, analytics: AnalyticsServiceProtocol) {&#10;        self.userRepository = userRepository&#10;        self.analytics = analytics&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func loadDashboard() async {&#10;        analytics.track(event: &quot;dashboard_viewed&quot;, properties: [:])&#10;        user = try? await userRepository.fetchCurrentUser()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AnalyticsServiceProtocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> track</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserRepositoryProtocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchCurrentUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DashboardViewModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ObservableObject </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @Published</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user: User</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userRepository: UserRepositoryProtocol</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analytics: AnalyticsServiceProtocol</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">userRepository</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: UserRepositoryProtocol, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">analytics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: AnalyticsServiceProtocol) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.userRepository </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.analytics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> analytics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadDashboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        analytics.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">track</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dashboard_viewed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try?</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userRepository.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fetchCurrentUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"属性注入-property-injection\">属性注入（Property Injection）</h3><p>通过属性赋值提供依赖，适用于可选依赖或框架约束场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"final class SettingsViewController: UIViewController {&#10;    var themeService: ThemeServiceProtocol?&#10;    var logger: LoggerProtocol?&#10;&#10;    override func viewDidLoad() {&#10;        super.viewDidLoad()&#10;        logger?.log(&quot;Settings screen loaded&quot;)&#10;        themeService?.apply(to: view)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SettingsViewController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UIViewController </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> themeService: ThemeServiceProtocol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logger: LoggerProtocol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    override</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> viewDidLoad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">viewDidLoad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        logger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Settings screen loaded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        themeService</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">apply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: view)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方法注入-method-injection\">方法注入（Method Injection）</h3><p>通过方法参数传入依赖，适合依赖只在特定操作中使用的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct ImageProcessor {&#10;    func resize(image: UIImage, using filter: ImageFilterProtocol) -&gt; UIImage {&#10;        let filtered = filter.apply(to: image)&#10;        return filtered.resized(to: CGSize(width: 200, height: 200))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func export(image: UIImage, encoder: ImageEncoderProtocol) -&gt; Data {&#10;        encoder.encode(image)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImageProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: UIImage, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">using</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filter: ImageFilterProtocol) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UIImage {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filtered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filter.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">apply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: image)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> filtered.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">resized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CGSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: UIImage, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">encoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: ImageEncoderProtocol) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Data {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        encoder.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(image)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"三种注入方式对比\">三种注入方式对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>构造器注入</th>\n<th>属性注入</th>\n<th>方法注入</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不可变性</td>\n<td>✅ 依赖不可变</td>\n<td>❌ 依赖可变</td>\n<td>✅ 参数不可变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必需依赖</td>\n<td>✅ 编译期保证</td>\n<td>❌ 运行时可能为 nil</td>\n<td>✅ 编译期保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可测试性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>默认选择</td>\n<td>可选依赖/框架限制</td>\n<td>操作级依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Swift 推荐度</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>⭐</td>\n<td>⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 优先使用构造器注入。只有当框架不支持（如 UIKit Storyboard 实例化）或依赖确实可选时，才考虑属性注入。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ioc-容器-vs-手动-di\">IoC 容器 vs 手动 DI</h2><h3 id=\"手动-di-pure-di\">手动 DI（Pure DI）</h3><p>直接在组合根（Composition Root）手动装配所有依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@MainActor&#10;final class AppDependencyContainer {&#10;    private lazy var httpClient: HTTPClientProtocol = URLSessionHTTPClient()&#10;    private lazy var userRepository: UserRepositoryProtocol = UserRepository(httpClient: httpClient)&#10;    private lazy var analyticsService: AnalyticsServiceProtocol = FirebaseAnalyticsService()&#10;&#10;    func makeDashboardViewModel() -&gt; DashboardViewModel {&#10;        DashboardViewModel(&#10;            userRepository: userRepository,&#10;            analytics: analyticsService&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func makeSettingsViewModel() -&gt; SettingsViewModel {&#10;        SettingsViewModel(&#10;            userRepository: userRepository&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func makeProfileViewModel(userId: String) -&gt; ProfileViewModel {&#10;        ProfileViewModel(&#10;            userId: userId,&#10;            userRepository: userRepository,&#10;            analytics: analyticsService&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@MainActor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppDependencyContainer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> httpClient: HTTPClientProtocol </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> URLSessionHTTPClient</span>